  "1ecd3b32-cd3e-4018-a45d-154036bdd835"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "Computes the normalized Frobenius mismatch ||S - T||_F / (||S||_F + \
||T||_F) between two matrices."
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"67db92b8-bbb0-4976-a608-bb7b7477bb0e"]
